From: OpenWrt desktop maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] rdp: deliver Unicode soft-keyboard input

Translate Unicode key-downs to complete strokes. Use the current keymap
when possible and temporarily borrow an unmapped X11-range key for other
Unicode scalars. Decode UTF-16 pairs, ignore releases, and wait for held
keys before changing a shared keymap. Never log typed text.

---

--- a/libweston/backend-rdp/rdp.c
+++ b/libweston/backend-rdp/rdp.c
@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@
